{"schema":"hrpn-ard-decision-focus/governance-scenes/v1","kit":{"repo":"sentropic","sha":"4138a0ecba9c5b37409abb5ac00f732d02b7dc8d","files":{"architecture-icons.js":"7a6b5c95fdc90dddf6340a2fc7f9aecce5010c393101b42a7d97826fe2ad1209","architecture-layout.js":"ec1547e5b22d98d2cd47bb84b1930fff4cd7fcc5e93c298074569d90b23692e9","architecture-routing.js":"4a181ba51080426ec77bc3dbf07ccfab1e6363f9bf5ce1363a659b0a7c47198e","architecture-svg.js":"9fa5d5c74709ab106dcd087430eb815164844d1ab2a2e0da582b5cdc6f1b0c8a","governance-font-metrics.js":"5f868f9e72bc64c4cbd9494540a4cf82c0adb5071474acdde481f6d3c58a0414","governance-layout.js":"98ca434d422a0685c68c418594452d8f768ecfd491764df992cf6c9dcb823430","hrpolnav-card.js":"8e1110f1a60b1d49630e29e5f479c69ee691588fe449c9ba2d976ecd7e2e475b","hrpolnav-card-font.js":"ec623350b6b4704daa7e12a44c922b2668b3b05824936808da7d0cf5429b141b","FrameToggle.svelte":"9ad3b30b8ccaaf37157f13adf8feb53c1f3d1a1c3dca4b4f436166879ef45cc6"}},"builtFrom":{"data":"f81fc3ebd8dec834f2e307e789713d51b08e74150de1d1eb9dc9939853c6ccdb","tintLegend":"cc47a3e3a2019af8c436ce28a34d0d52d71b8439cf55a44a33f1c0239752a26d"},"sha256":"d38d983d608b89eccb6531b0d91f9c1d96b099165557fc5005a9f2419111b772","report":{"S2-asbuilt":{"default":{"ms":319,"visibleCards":32,"visibleZones":15,"relations":33,"crossingsAllowed":16,"overlapsAllowed":0,"labelsFallback":16},"expanded":{"ms":537,"visibleCards":47,"visibleZones":18,"relations":44,"crossingsAllowed":19,"overlapsAllowed":1,"labelsFallback":20},"folded":{"ms":2,"visibleCards":0,"visibleZones":5,"relations":5,"crossingsAllowed":1,"overlapsAllowed":0,"labelsFallback":3}},"S2-target":{"default":{"ms":75,"visibleCards":16,"visibleZones":19,"relations":21,"crossingsAllowed":8,"overlapsAllowed":0,"labelsFallback":7},"expanded":{"ms":222,"visibleCards":37,"visibleZones":19,"relations":31,"crossingsAllowed":12,"overlapsAllowed":0,"labelsFallback":9},"folded":{"ms":2,"visibleCards":0,"visibleZones":5,"relations":6,"crossingsAllowed":1,"overlapsAllowed":0,"labelsFallback":3}},"S1-conversational":{"default":{"ms":49,"visibleCards":25,"visibleZones":12,"relations":22,"crossingsAllowed":8,"overlapsAllowed":0,"labelsFallback":7},"expanded":{"ms":81,"visibleCards":30,"visibleZones":18,"relations":24,"crossingsAllowed":8,"overlapsAllowed":0,"labelsFallback":7},"folded":{"ms":2,"visibleCards":0,"visibleZones":5,"relations":5,"crossingsAllowed":2,"overlapsAllowed":0,"labelsFallback":2}},"S3-agentfactory":{"default":{"ms":201,"visibleCards":41,"visibleZones":13,"relations":34,"crossingsAllowed":16,"overlapsAllowed":0,"labelsFallback":8},"expanded":{"ms":325,"visibleCards":44,"visibleZones":16,"relations":36,"crossingsAllowed":18,"overlapsAllowed":0,"labelsFallback":10},"folded":{"ms":2,"visibleCards":0,"visibleZones":5,"relations":6,"crossingsAllowed":2,"overlapsAllowed":0,"labelsFallback":3}}},"scenes":{"S2-asbuilt":{"sceneHash":"a326e51ca1f5e6946b42d8792e1e352ca6a3a8190520d91f0a2f020eb3c473e3","defaults":["CICDZ","SSMPROJ","PRODZ","OUT"],"model":{"id":"S2-asbuilt","language":"en","title":"Option 2 as built · HRPN main @667529f (2026-10-12)","shortCaption":"Option 2 as built · HRPN main @667529f (2026-10-12)","caption":"Source of truth: this repository at `main` @667529f (`genair-infra-factory/`, `src/agents/ragengine-agent/`). A Google Chat app\npublishes to the Pub/Sub topic `hrpn-gchat-events`; a push subscription with an OIDC token of the pod service account calls\n`/gchat-push` on Cloud Run `hrpn-ragengine-agent`, a FastAPI app from ADK `get_fast_api_app` that also serves the ADK web UI (CORS `*`).\nThe route answers 200 first, then a background task runs the `LlmAgent` (gemini-2.5-flash, generic `GenAiR_RAG_Agent` prompt) on\nVertex AI RAG Engine (RagManaged Basic, corpus `hr_policies`) and replies through the Chat REST API.\nRed frames: Chat sessions in `InMemorySessionService` keyed by the space name (lost on restart, shared in group spaces), no event check\nor dedup, corpus admin tools callable by any user, user text logged at INFO; absent: citations, 1–5 feedback, eligibility check, Drive sync.\nTwo runtimes coexist: Agent Engine `hrpn-ae-ragengine-agent` (AdkApp, Terraform) is deployed but no Chat path calls it (deployed state verified 2026-10-19: engine 6891800455551123456 beside Cloud Run revision `00005-fqc`; the out-of-Terraform LB backend `hrpn-gchat-push-backend` exists, unused by the push subscription, which targets the `*.run.app` URL).\nTemplate bricks without a consumer (bucket, Firestore, Phoenix, feedback sink) stay visible as dormant. End-to-end delivery: `unknown` after the 2026-10-12 commits (org policy `iam.allowedPolicyMemberDomains` blocked earlier paths).\nPlatform inheritance: GenAiR-Cutter 26.9.0 (github.airbus.corp, AgentGarden as submodule) generated the repo and pushed it to the POD SSM repository `prj-ssm-b967/hr-polnav-c700-repo`; Terraform reads the genair-infra-factory modules from their SSM mirror; Cloud Build (same POD project) deploys on the SSM webhook. Everything runs in POD: the PROD mode of the template (`app_code`, dev/int/pro projects, Jenkins on AWS with WIF) was not run, and no HRPN repository on the Airbus SCM (GitLab / GitHub) was found (red frames).","foldedHeight":200,"zoneGapY":96,"legend":"Tints: blue `genair` = native GenAiR template / Cutter / AgentGarden code; yellow `specific` = HRPN-specific code (commits after \"Created with GenAiR-cutter\", 2026-09-25 → 2026-10-12); orange `added` = target addition needed; red `removed` = to remove in the target; red frame `risk` = present but weak or at risk; no tint = Google or third-party managed service. Dashed links = dormant, optional or not built.","bands":[],"junctions":[],"groups":[{"id":"PEOPLE","parentId":null,"zoneKicker":"PPL","title":"Users and operators","subtitle":"Employees HR · Developers admin","tone":"neutral","tint":null,"icon":"people","cardFooter":"scope: Users and operators","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"width":0,"height":0},{"id":"WS","parentId":null,"zoneKicker"