ntime","shortCaption":"Option 2 decided target · Pub/Sub → Cloud Run single runtime","caption":"Decided target of option B in the PROD environment only (owner, 2026-10-22), the target figure of the ARD (owner round r1, 2026-10-19; S2 2026-10-20).\nD1 = B: one runtime, the Cloud Run backend (GenAiR FastAPI server) running the ADK agent in process, in the pro project of the PROD landing zone.\nS3 = Pub/Sub: Chat app → events topic → push subscription (OIDC, dedicated push service account) → Google Chat API integration (`/gchat-push`,\nevent check and dedup, reply, 1–5 rating) → agent. S1 = RAG Engine. S2 = Firestore (`FirestoreSessionService`, `hrpn-sessions`, TTL for the 1-year history of HR04).\nLayout after the Google Cloud standard landing zone: app project, Observability next to the CI/CD project, PROD SSM in the CI/CD project (ssm = cicd project).\nColours: blue = GenAiR standard; green = customisation within the GenAiR template frame, data services included; yellow = added outside the frame\n(Pub/Sub, Google Chat API integration); no fill = Google or third-party managed service. HR01 = A without ChatUI: no load balancer, IAP or ADK web UI.\nOpen: gate G1 (publisher exception, VPC-SC), PROD project ids, SCM host, PROD SSM mirror.\nPROD (GenAiR-Cutter PROD mode): `--prod` regeneration with an `app_code`; SCM push → Jenkins on AWS (WIF `iac-sa`) → `main` → pro.","foldedHeight":200,"zoneGapY":96,"legend":"Tints: blue `genair` = GenAiR standard; green `custom` = customisation within the GenAiR template frame, data services included; yellow `outside` = specific for HRPN, added outside the template frame; no tint = Google or third-party managed service. A folded box takes the tint of its content. Dashed links = dormant, optional or not built.","bands":[],"junctions":[],"groups":[{"id":"PEOPLE","parentId":null,"zoneKicker":"PPL","title":"Users and operators","subtitle":"Employees HR · Developers admin · HR content owners","tone":"neutral","tint":null,"icon":"people","c