}],"routePoints":[{"x":1108,"y":100},{"x":1108,"y":228},{"x":592,"y":228},{"x":592,"y":428}],"routedPoints":[{"x":1080,"y":100},{"x":1108,"y":100},{"x":1108,"y":228},{"x":592,"y":228},{"x":592,"y":428},{"x":620,"y":428}],"clearance":28,"obstacleDetour":true,"labelPoint":{"x":850,"y":228},"labelBox":{"left":739.5,"right":960.5,"top":209,"bottom":247},"labelLines":["GenAiR libs (PROD)"],"labelAnchor":{"x":850,"y":228},"labelEdgeFraction":0.46,"labelLeader":null},"type":"architecture","sourceHandle":"source-right-5","targetHandle":"target-left-6.92"},{"id":"JENKINS__PIAC__3d4be535ed8f","source":"OUT","target":"GCP","label":"3 links","class":"flow","data":{"labelFontSize":21,"pillLabel":true,"relations":[{"id":"JENKINS__PIAC__3d4be535ed8f","label":"WIF · iac-sa"},{"id":"JENKINS__PAR__a0d29d8e1a8c","label":"docker push"},{"id":"JENKINS__APP__159ad0a11e96","label":"deploy · main"}],"routePoints":[{"x":1108,"y":396},{"x":1108,"y":508},{"x":586,"y":508},{"x":586,"y":150}],"routedPoints":[{"x":1080,"y":396},{"x":1108,"y":396},{"x":1108,"y":508},{"x":586,"y":508},{"x":586,"y":150},{"x":620,"y":150}],"clearance":28,"obstacleDetour":true,"labelPoint":{"x":586,"y":257.4},"labelBox":{"left":541,"right":631,"top":238.39999999999998,"bottom":276.4},"labelLines":["3 links"],"labelFallback":true},"type":"architecture","sourceHandle":"source-right-5","targetHandle":"target-left-8"}],"routing":{"crossingsAllowed":["DEV__SCMREPO__3ed7fe663fd2"],"overlapsAllowed":[],"labelsFallback":["CHATAPI__CHAT__c4b05047138c","DEV__SCMREPO__3ed7fe663fd2","JENKINS__PIAC__3d4be535ed8f"]}}]},"S1-conversational":{"sceneHash":"9d68d35baf4bdd8a5bf6ec55a87c9a48bbc84a6018f028e21f048c57d8a95884","defaults":["PRODZ","OUT"],"model":{"id":"S1-conversational","language":"en","title":"Option 1 · Conversational Agent (PoC-equivalent)","shortCaption":"Option 1 · Conversational Agent (PoC-equivalent)","caption":"PoC-equivalent low-code path from the GenAiR low-code docs (Conversational Agents = renamed Dialogflow CX: generative playbook,\ndata store tool, Google Chat integration), the GenAiR template exports, the ARB deck (slides 2, 4) and the ARD (FP1–FP6).\nEmployees ask in a Google Chat space; the Chat integration (or, per ARD FP1, an Apps Script router) reaches an agent whose playbook\ngrounds Gemini answers on a Vertex AI Search data store fed from a GCS bucket (Phase 1 manual upload; Phase 2 Drive sync not built).\nTwo PoC Cloud Run tools are called from the playbook: Link Formatter and Row-Level Access Security (dormant); logs go to BigQuery (FP6).\nRed frames: no GenAiR production template, IaC or CI path for Conversational Agents (GenAiR-Cutter offers Cloud Run / Agent Engine only;\nconsole build and zip restore), the Dialogflow ↔ Chat connection was rejected in POD (`auth.creds.useNormalUserEUC`, handover §C,\nobserved with Dialogflow ES), the Apps Script route needs a VPC-SC ingress rule per user identity. The PoC agent export was not found: `source-gap`.\nInheritance and environments: the agent starts from the `genair-conversational-agent` exports of `Airbus/GenAiR` (github.airbus.corp). With no Cutter template, the PROD dev / int / pro projects (orange, GenAiR PROD model) would each receive a manual console restore of an export versioned on the Airbus SCM (GitLab or GitHub: open); no webhook, no Jenkins job and no IaC exist for this path. Project ids: unknown.","foldedHeight":200,"zoneGapY":96,"legend":"Tints: blue `genair` = native GenAiR template / Cutter / AgentGarden code; yellow `specific` = HRPN-specific code (commits after \"Created with GenAiR-cutter\", 2026-09-25 → 2026-10-12); orange `added` = target addition needed; red `removed` = to remove in the target; red frame `risk` = present but weak or at risk; no tint = Google or third-party managed service. Dashed links = dormant, optional or not built.","bands":[],"junctions":[],"groups":[{"id":"PEOPLE","parentId":null,"zoneKicker":"PPL","title":"Users and operators","subtitle":"Employees HR · HR content owne