},{"x":1108,"y":268},{"x":802,"y":268},{"x":802,"y":364}],"routedPoints":[{"x":1240,"y":120},{"x":1108,"y":120},{"x":1108,"y":268},{"x":802,"y":268},{"x":802,"y":364},{"x":770,"y":364}],"clearance":28,"obstacleDetour":true,"labelPoint":{"x":955,"y":268},"labelBox":{"left":838.5,"right":1071.5,"top":249,"bottom":287},"labelLines":["export JSON · push"],"labelAnchor":{"x":955,"y":268},"labelEdgeFraction":0.6064425770308123,"labelLeader":null},"type":"architecture","sourceHandle":"source-left-6.2","targetHandle":"target-right-3.08"}],"routing":{"crossingsAllowed":["EXPORT__SCMREPO__19793062b717","HRADM__DOCS__afb50962c784"],"overlapsAllowed":[],"labelsFallback":["HRADM__DOCS__afb50962c784","GENTPL__EXPORT__cb221df88a82"]}}]},"S3-agentfactory":{"sceneHash":"5d944d5441bc0a94c83f6ed78c1e050ba12b43b08bcb4fc65ce1475d13abf55f","defaults":["OUT"],"model":{"id":"S3-agentfactory","language":"en","title":"Option 3 hypothesis · Agent Factory (AgentAiR)","shortCaption":"Option 3 hypothesis · Agent Factory (AgentAiR)","caption":"Hypothesis drawn on the AgentAiR overview draw.io, zoning kept: 85BB PCP-GCP ⊃ 4AE9 AI Platform ⊃ 7EFD Everyday AI (Agent\nFactory model: Gemini Enterprise; Agent Platform with Agent Gateway (IAP), Policies, Model Armor, Agent Registry / Runtime), C9EC Datahub\nand the platform cells (logging, connectivity, Model Armor floor, VPC SC, governed APIs, IAM/PAB); links follow the draw.io relations.\nHRPN adds its ADK `root_agent` (already wrapped as `AdkApp`) registered on Agent Runtime, its tools, and an AAI HR spoke project with\nRAG Engine, documents bucket and Drive sync (ARB slide 7 hub-and-spoke, slide 9 \"Agent Factory · AAI HR instance\").\nGoogle Chat is NOT the channel here: users reach the agent in the Gemini Enterprise app, so BRD-HR-010 (Chat, mandatory) needs a waiver.\nRed frames: Agent Engine POD-only, not in the production landing zone (HR master ARD note 2026-02-27, to recheck); Gemini Enterprise\nplanned Q4 2026, not SEC4AI-assessed; Agent Runtime under VPC-SC needs `min_instances` ≥ 1; PSL spoke template end 2026, retrofit required.\nFeasibility precedent outside Airbus: ADK agent on Agent Runtime registered in Gemini Enterprise Business with a cross-project IAM grant.\nDelivery (hypothesis): the ADK code keeps its GenAiR-Cutter / AgentGarden origin, lives on the Airbus SCM and reaches the platform through the Airbus CI/CD (the AgentAiR constraint list says \"CI/CD of Airbus (Gitlab, Jenkins …) tbc\"); the spoke environments (dev / int / pro) and their project ids are unknown.","foldedHeight":200,"zoneGapY":96,"legend":"Tints: blue `genair` = native GenAiR template / Cutter / AgentGarden code; yellow `specific` = HRPN-specific code (commits after \"Created with GenAiR-cutter\", 2026-09-25 → 2026-10-12); orange `added` = target addition needed; red `removed` = to remove in the target; red frame `risk` = present but weak or at risk; no tint = Google or third-party managed service. Dashed links = dormant, optional or not built.","bands":[],"junctions":[],"groups":[{"id":"LEFT","parentId":null,"zoneKicker":"AIRBUS SECURITY","title":"Users and security","subtitle":"Employees HR · CASB Netskope · Identity keys · SIEM SOC","tone":"neutral","tint":null,"icon":"people","cardFooter":"scope: Airbus security","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"width":0,"height":0},{"id":"PCP","parentId":null,"zoneKicker":"85BB PCP-GCP","title":"PCP-GCP","subtitle":"85BB","tone":"neutral","tint":null,"icon":"cloud","cardFooter":"service: 85BB PCP-GCP","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"width":0,"height":0},{"id":"AIP","parentId":"PCP","zoneKicker":"4AE9 AI PLATFORM","title":"AI Platform","subtitle":"4AE9","tone":"neutral","tint":null,"icon":"server","cardFooter":"service: 4AE9 AI Platform","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"width":0,"height":0},{"id":"EAI","parentId":"AIP","zoneKicker":"7EFD EVERYDAY AI","title":"Everyday AI","subtitle":"Agent Factory model · 7EFD","tone":"neutral","tint":null,"icon":"server","cardFooter":"service: 7EFD Everyday AI","position